        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I lived here 2 nights. The room is clean, and very cheap, good for travel alone. Just point one little thing, the hot water in tub is different to get, you need to run the water approximately 5 min to get it",
        "time": 1769269574,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Josh Stewart",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104436848901238518125/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXc6QzLvusAz6j4ZdFhZl4Q8nuw1Ir3vGnmp4GlVbLkSBaKEGqP_Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Stayed here for one night during a quick trip in and out of Montreal. Room was quite dated but it did the trick, it was clean, warm, and had a small fridge and microwave. Perfect for what we needed. And the staff was super pleasant and greeted us kindly when we arrived and left. Would recommend if you need a quick one night stay.",
        "time": 1701982684,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sam Alman",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105013909475516733409/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2hGWvfK3ChzJuOqlA75iu-K-G2YlHcEhag-txpRiwBSybuoNH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The motel room #4 needs major upgrade to even be considered okay. Very rundown.",
        "time": 1756480345,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Atlas Del Mar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113055728806570083626/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXKdW-wiAuDQAzmQka2jsFy_wl2-iEigRuYIVXa_-9Yi1Jz6pRe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I chose a motel that was conveniently on the route I was driving on as I transited through Quebec. I thought that a room for under a hundred dollars a night would be okay,(you get what you pay for). There wasn't any hot water, the room was run down and I slept wearing my jacket on top of the sheets. I didn't have a good experience but the customer service was good. I've learned my lesson.",
        "time": 1642992795,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Stéphane Pigeon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103264150334839415475/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVYX_e5L9WHMFapUfCt2mfQGe6hcW9cjyxxelYmUbWb5E-P9aIt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Better than expected for the price. Lady at front desk was nice, room was ok except for a few cobwebs on lamps and cigarette burns on bedsheets. Bathroom door was locked and I had to pick it with a coat hanger, room key did not work for bathroom. No bad smells. All in all acceptable for a quick 1 night stop.",
        "time": 1542564220,
